  "body": "The optional 'radiusY' and 'rotation' parameters were added to the spec four years ago (part of git commit e25d3f909451285947de75dc56bdba2fad14692c) and have not been implemented by anyone (AFAICT).  If nobody really wants them, we should remove these from the spec.\n",
